  "limitations": [
    "Published site follower totals and creator updates do not reveal buyer identity, first purchase, repeat buyer count, or paid demand.",
    "External Patreon tier eligibility provides access keys at claim time, but such entitlements do not measure native itch.io paid orders or membership renewal.",
    "An eligible customer at 30 days is not automatically in the 365-day cohort; include right-censoring in long windows.",
    "Game key claims, copies owned and billing renewals are three distinct event classes.",
    "Absent consented merchant transaction and external membership aggregates, all actual repeat demand and churn estimates stay unknown."
